    msg "书中新增了一页。"

translate schinese_rewrite Forgotten_Sanctuary_Loop_18aa8f13:

    # "It's for the best if you leave it here for now - it's been preserved up until now, why disturb it."
    "现在还是把它留在这里为好——它一直保存到如今，何必贸然惊扰？"

translate schinese_rewrite Forgotten_Sanctuary_Loop_db40e2e2:

    # "You walk through the door, there seem to be a huge... slime right in front of you..."
    "你穿过门，眼前似乎堵着一只巨大的……史莱姆……"

translate schinese_rewrite Forgotten_Sanctuary_Loop_db40e2e2_1:

    # "You walk through the door, there seem to be a huge... slime right in front of you..."
    "你穿过门，眼前似乎堵着一只巨大的……史莱姆……"

translate schinese_rewrite Forgotten_Sanctuary_Loop_754b1c21:

    # "You walk through the back of the shrine... A huge slime, almost twice your height, appears in front of you."
