    # "Suddenly the chest jumps right into your face, it's not a chest, it is a mimic."
    "宝箱突然扑到你脸上——那根本不是宝箱，而是一只宝箱怪。"

translate schinese_rewrite Whispering_Hollow_Loop_384c5823:

    # "Mimic" "RAWAWWWR-"
    "嗷呜呜呜——" "RAWWWWWWWWWWW-"

translate schinese_rewrite Whispering_Hollow_Loop_68fd897f:

    # "You scream, its tongue is slithering out, trying to latch on you..."
    "你尖叫起来；它伸出舌头，正试图缠住你……"

translate schinese_rewrite Whispering_Hollow_Loop_8f4b5a9c:

    # ww "Hey, dude. Guess what, Uffe doesn't let me return to our den."
    ww "嘿，伙计。猜猜怎么着，乌菲不让回咱们的巢穴了。"

translate schinese_rewrite Whispering_Hollow_Loop_4e7ff085:

    # e "That's a bummer."
    e "真够倒霉的。"

translate schinese_rewrite Whispering_Hollow_Loop_3cbaec72:

    # ww "Yeah, yeah."
    ww "是，是。"

translate schinese_rewrite Whispering_Hollow_Loop_8fda86e4:

    # "The werewolf continues watching over the empty hollow."
    "狼人继续守望着空荡荡的洞窟。"

translate schinese_rewrite Whispering_Hollow_Loop_1b037ac5:

    # ww "Oh... damn. You've done it."
    ww "哦……该死，你做到了。"

translate schinese_rewrite Whispering_Hollow_Loop_69b862df:

    # ww "Turns out, what I need to put there is in my pocket all along!"
    ww "原来我一直把该放进去的东西揣在兜里！"

translate schinese_rewrite Whispering_Hollow_Loop_0029ca51:

    # "The werewolf reveals a piece of iron from his loincloth."
    "狼人从腰布里掏出一块铁片。"

translate schinese_rewrite Whispering_Hollow_Loop_1b78a4f9:

    # ww "I was going to solve it so easily, if only all of the answers were meat, hmmm..."
    ww "要是所有答案都是肉，我早就轻轻松松解出来了，嗯……"

translate schinese_rewrite Whispering_Hollow_Loop_43ca3024:

    # e "Yeah, guess I'm going back to Uffe with the amulet."
    e "好吧，我想我该带着护身符回去找乌菲了。"

translate schinese_rewrite Whispering_Hollow_Loop_0c6e7e10:

    # ww "Good luck, dude."
    ww "祝你好运，伙计。"

translate schinese_rewrite Whispering_Hollow_Loop_ca52a0cf:

    # ww "Oh, and remember to clear the shrubs. We're going to hunt down much more preys here."
    ww "对了，记得把灌木清干净。我们以后要在这里猎更多猎物。"

translate schinese_rewrite Whispering_Hollow_Loop_2255f5d6:

    # "He waves you a farewell, before sitting lazily."
    "他向你挥手道别，随后懒洋洋地坐下。"

translate schinese_rewrite Whispering_Hollow_Loop_5f7b93b1:

    # "You notice a huge werewolf peeking by the side of the hollow."
    "你注意到一只巨大的狼人正从洞窟一侧探头窥视。"

translate schinese_rewrite Whispering_Hollow_Loop_ba53a226:

    # "He looks worried, to say the least. Not overly aggressive like the others."
    "至少可以说，他看起来很忧虑。不像其他狼人那样充满攻击性。"

translate schinese_rewrite Whispering_Hollow_Loop_581629cf:

    # ww "Oh?"
    ww "哦？"

translate schinese_rewrite Whispering_Hollow_Loop_dde308d5:

    # "The werewolf notices you."
    "狼人注意到了你。"

translate schinese_rewrite Whispering_Hollow_Loop_01491e7b:

    # ww "Uffe sent you?"
    ww "乌菲派你来的？"

translate schinese_rewrite Whispering_Hollow_Loop_18967a55:

    # e "Uhm... yes. I was worried you're going to attack me."
    e "呃……是的。我还担心你会袭击我。"

translate schinese_rewrite Whispering_Hollow_Loop_eaf21e66:

    # ww "N-no. We don't have time for that."
    ww "不、不。我们没工夫做那种事。"

translate schinese_rewrite Whispering_Hollow_Loop_92db29ba:

    # "Both of you remain silent for a minute, as the werewolf removes his gaze on you."
    "你们沉默了一分钟，狼人把目光从你身上移开。"

translate schinese_rewrite Whispering_Hollow_Loop_fdcb1662:

    # "He takes another glance at the paper, and looks over the hollow."
    "他又看了眼纸条，随后望向洞窟。"

translate schinese_rewrite Whispering_Hollow_Loop_10fe600a:

    # ww "Fuck, man. Why do we even bother with this thing."
    ww "妈的，伙计。我们到底干吗还要费劲解这个？"

translate schinese_rewrite Whispering_Hollow_Loop_74cdafb0:

    # ww "We can't even speak our words among us werewolves, the situation has been tense ever since the brother became a monster."
    ww "我们狼人之间甚至不能畅所欲言；自从兄弟变成怪物后，气氛一直很紧张。"

translate schinese_rewrite Whispering_Hollow_Loop_96edca9c:

    # ww "We missed the time where we simply hunt our prey, or dig out some rocks."
    ww "我们已经错过了只需捕猎、挖石头的日子。"

translate schinese_rewrite Whispering_Hollow_Loop_b6d9a4a4:

    # "It seems the werewolf is spilling out everything onto you."
    "看来狼人把压在心里的话全都倾诉给了你。"

translate schinese_rewrite Whispering_Hollow_Loop_59f65580:

    # "As much as you want to tell him that you, alongside Wuldon and Vurro, will make sure the present would not last."
    "你很想告诉他，你会和沃尔顿、武罗一起，让这样的日子不再继续。"

translate schinese_rewrite Whispering_Hollow_Loop_9dd13eeb:

    # "That won't be a possibility unless you fully trust this werewolf."
    "但除非你完全信任这只狼人，否则这不可能实现。"

translate schinese_rewrite Whispering_Hollow_Loop_161e067d:

    # ww "The brother was dead, thanks? Uffe told us he can smell what had happened in the cave."
    ww "兄弟已经死了——谢天谢地？乌菲告诉我们，他能闻出洞穴里发生过什么。"

translate schinese_rewrite Whispering_Hollow_Loop_c9f26be8:

    # "The werewolf scratches his snout with uncertainty."
    "狼人不安地挠了挠鼻尖。"

translate schinese_rewrite Whispering_Hollow_Loop_7fbe5ed9:

    # ww "We can only hope times will get better, maybe if Uffe trusts me I can finally be the one who hunts."
    ww "我们只能希望日子会好起来。也许等乌菲信任我，我就终于能成为负责捕猎的那个。"

translate schinese_rewrite Whispering_Hollow_Loop_2ca5cb50:

    # ww "Anyway, the hollow, we have no clue what that pillar's talking about..."
    ww "总之，这个洞窟……我们完全不知道那根柱子在说什么……"

translate schinese_rewrite Whispering_Hollow_Loop_d5b5c1d4:

    # "The werewolf points at the plate, with a paragraph of words."
    "狼人指向那块刻着一段文字的石板。"

translate schinese_rewrite Whispering_Hollow_Loop_ffaaf9a0:

    # ww "{i}I am hard and unyielding, yet shaped by skilled hands.{w}{p}I can be honed to a deadly point, or used to till the land.{p}{w}What am I?{/i}"
    ww "{i}我坚硬而不屈，却能由巧手塑成形。{w}{p}我可以被磨利至足以致命，也能用来耕作土地。{p}{w}我是什么？{/i}"

translate schinese_rewrite Whispering_Hollow_Loop_7429056a:

    # "He finishes the riddle with a loud sigh."
    "他长叹一声，说完了谜语。"

translate schinese_rewrite Whispering_Hollow_Loop_e9bd0086:

    # ww "W-what can it be? We've spent a whole week over this, maybe it's food, or... meat? That's not right."
    ww "这到底会是什么？我们为此琢磨整整一周了，也许是食物，或者……肉？不对。"

translate schinese_rewrite Whispering_Hollow_Loop_c4089a3e:

    # ww "Or..."
    ww "或者……"

translate schinese_rewrite Whispering_Hollow_Loop_d3066dc2:

    # ww "Maybe it's food! Y-yes. Food. W-wait a minute..."
    ww "也许就是食物！对、对，食物。等、等一下……"

translate schinese_rewrite Whispering_Hollow_Loop_c0becb45:

    # "The werewolf falls into another period of pondering, you decide to leave him alone, and inspect the pillars."
    "狼人又陷入沉思。你决定先不打扰他，去检查那些石柱。"

translate schinese_rewrite Whispering_Hollow_Loop_5f7b93b1_1:

    # "You notice a huge werewolf peeking by the side of the hollow."
    "你注意到一只巨大的狼人正从洞窟一侧探头窥视。"

translate schinese_rewrite Whispering_Hollow_Loop_d2edc994:

    # ww "W-what can that mean? Hard and Unyielding... My cock can be like that, maybe not {i}honed to a deadly point.{/i}"
    ww "那、那到底是什么意思？坚硬而不屈……我的老二也能硬成那样，可能吧——不过肯定不是{i}磨利至足以致命{/i}。"

translate schinese_rewrite Whispering_Hollow_Loop_ade48d60:

    # ww "Wouldn't make sense to {i}till the land{/i} also."
    ww "用来{i}耕作土地{/i}也说不通。"

translate schinese_rewrite Whispering_Hollow_Loop_85d2bd74:

    # ww "But I can put my cock on the pillar, it'll probably fit."
    ww "不过我可以把我的老二插到那根柱子上，应该塞得进去。"

translate schinese_rewrite Whispering_Hollow_Loop_06eefad7:

    # "Yes, that would not make sense, as you thought."
    "没错，正如你所想，这完全说不通。"

translate schinese_rewrite Whispering_Hollow_Loop_e04bf7d7:

    # ww "Oh hey! The amulet is right there! How did you do that?"
    ww "哦，嘿！护身符就在那儿！你是怎么做到的？"

translate schinese_rewrite Whispering_Hollow_Loop_16c35601:

    # ww "Wait, the beasts of the night, isn't that... us?"
    ww "等等，夜里的野兽……说的不就是我们？"

translate schinese_rewrite Whispering_Hollow_Loop_0813b5d5:

    # ww "Why would they repel us, must be something from the tasty goats again..."
    ww "它们为什么会驱赶我们？肯定又和那些美味的山羊有关……"

translate schinese_rewrite Whispering_Hollow_Loop_5b5e3936:

    # ww "They could have something there up their slippery sleeves."
    ww "它们袖子底下肯定藏着什么滑溜溜的东西。"

translate schinese_rewrite Whispering_Hollow_Loop_c2de7c62:

    # ww "Whisper that brushes, sounds like my fur. Mine's delicate also."
    ww "轻轻拂过的耳语，听起来像我的毛。我的毛也很柔软。"

translate schinese_rewrite Whispering_Hollow_Loop_42c1113e:

    # ww "My cock's... uh... more like a howl. But... dances with the wind?"
    ww "我的老二……呃……更像一声嚎叫。不过……和风一起起舞？"

translate schinese_rewrite Whispering_Hollow_Loop_097aaf9d:

    # ww "Stop being poetic! This is getting me so angry I can tear a bird in half!"
    ww "别再吟诗了！我都快气得把鸟撕成两半了！"

translate schinese_rewrite Whispering_Hollow_Loop_c0eb9969:

    # ww "Chime... gentle? That sounds so obvious, it's the fuckin' bear's horn, right?"
    ww "叮铃……轻柔？这也太明显了，答案是那头该死的熊的号角，对吧？"

translate schinese_rewrite Whispering_Hollow_Loop_b76295a5:

    # ww "That gives me shivers every time they try that across the mountains from here."
    ww "每次它们试着从这附近的山那头吹响号角，我都浑身发颤。"

translate schinese_rewrite Whispering_Hollow_Loop_ae7aef8a:

    # ww "But seriously, where can I get a horn, from somwhere that's close enough, preferably a prey?"
    ww "不过说真的，我上哪儿找一只号角？最好得来自离这里够近的地方——比如猎物身上？"

translate schinese_rewrite Whispering_Hollow_Loop_c3bdd561:

    # ww "Warmth, bones. Sounds like a proper feast in my pack. the only thing missing is the meat."
    ww "温暖，骨头。听起来像我们狼群的一顿丰盛宴席；唯一缺的就是肉。"

translate schinese_rewrite Whispering_Hollow_Loop_fbc48ab5:

    # ww "But meat's not bitter, and it's a drink. Doesn't sound like something we have... unless we're talking about blood."
    ww "可肉不是苦的，也不是饮料。听起来不像我们拥有的东西……除非说的是血。"

translate schinese_rewrite Whispering_Hollow_Loop_0ba2839c:

    # ww "Though, what did we drink in the feast? We always had that at full moon, Can't bring myself to remember that stuff."
    ww "不过，我们在宴席上喝的到底是什么？每次满月都有，我就是想不起那玩意儿。"

translate schinese_rewrite Whispering_Hollow_Loop_5e281fac:

    # ww "Hard and Unyielding..."
    ww "坚硬而不屈……"

translate schinese_rewrite Whispering_Hollow_Loop_562a271e:

    # ww "...What if it's something from the ground? We've had that in the mines before..."
    ww "……要是它是从地里挖出来的东西呢？我们以前在矿井里见过这种东西……"

translate schinese_rewrite Whispering_Hollow_Loop_7031d355:

    # "You leave the werewolf alone to his thought once again."
    "你再次把狼人独自留在那里思考。"

translate schinese_rewrite Whispering_Hollow_Loop_63639cea:

    # "After cutting through the last shrub, it seems you've cleared the area."
    "砍倒最后一丛灌木后，看起来你已经清理完这片区域。"

translate schinese_rewrite Whispering_Hollow_Loop_73cc25dc:

    # "The Pillar says..."
    "石柱上写着……"

translate schinese_rewrite Whispering_Hollow_Loop_a5a943bb:

    # "{i}Small and dainty, I fit in your hand, my chime is gentle, but can be grand.{w}{p}With a flick of your wrist, I sing a tune, a sound that echoes, morning or noon.{p}{w}What am I?{/i}"
    "{i}小巧玲珑，恰好能握在掌中；我的铃声轻柔，却也能声势宏大。{w}{p}手腕轻轻一抖，我便唱起曲调，声音在清晨或正午回荡。{p}{w}我是什么？{/i}"

translate schinese_rewrite Whispering_Hollow_Loop_73cc25dc_1:

    # "The Pillar says..."
    "石柱上写着……"

translate schinese_rewrite Whispering_Hollow_Loop_ebf519a8:

    # "{i}I am a drink that can be sweet or bitter, a liquid that flows from a wooden splitter.{w}{p}I make you forget your troubles and strife, and bring warmth to your bones on a cold winter's night.{p}{w}What am I?{/i}"
    "{i}我是或甜或苦的饮品，一种从木制酒龙头中流出的液体。{w}{p}我让你忘却烦恼与争斗，在寒冬之夜温暖你的骨头。{p}{w}我是什么？{/i}"

translate schinese_rewrite Whispering_Hollow_Loop_73cc25dc_2:

    # "The Pillar says..."
    "石柱上写着……"

translate schinese_rewrite Whispering_Hollow_Loop_8866c5d2:

    # "{i}Bitter and rough, my leaves do abound, a herb of magic, both lost and found.{w}{p}My scent repels the beasts of the night, but for the cough, I bring relief in sight.{p}{w}What am I?{/i}"
    "{i}我的叶片苦涩粗糙，茂密地生长；这是一种失而复得的魔法药草。{w}{p}我的气味能驱逐夜间的野兽，却能为咳嗽带来缓解。{p}{w}我是什么？{/i}"

translate schinese_rewrite Whispering_Hollow_Loop_73cc25dc_3:

    # "The Pillar says..."
    "石柱上写着……"

translate schinese_rewrite Whispering_Hollow_Loop_bbe8d806:

    # "{i}I am a whisper that brushes the air, a delicate thing that's both here and there.{w}{p}My touch is gentle, my sway is light, I dance with the wind, and vanish from sight.{p}{w}What am I?{/i}"
    "{i}我是拂过空气的轻声细语，一件若即若离的精巧之物。{w}{p}我的触感温柔，摇曳轻盈；我随风起舞，然后从视野中消失。{p}{w}我是什么？{/i}"

translate schinese_rewrite Whispering_Hollow_Loop_73cc25dc_4:

    # "The Pillar says..."
    "石柱上写着……"

translate schinese_rewrite Whispering_Hollow_Loop_ae841a1c:

    # "{i}I am hard and unyielding, yet shaped by skilled hands.{w}{p}I can be honed to a deadly point, or used to till the land.{p}{w}What am I?{/i}"
    "{i}我坚硬而不屈，却能由巧手塑成形。{w}{p}我可以被磨利至足以致命，也能用来耕作土地。{p}{w}我是什么？{/i}"

translate schinese_rewrite Whispering_Hollow_Loop_e741ea35:

    # "The broken pillar next to you begin to glow."
    "旁边那根断裂的石柱开始发光。"

translate schinese_rewrite Whispering_Hollow_Loop_66cd190b:

    # "As you blink, an amulet suddenly appears out of thin air on top of the stone pillar."
    "你眨了眨眼，一个护身符突然凭空出现在石柱顶端。"

translate schinese_rewrite Whispering_Hollow_Loop_3c6a1d54:

    # "You stare at the broken pillar, there seems to be an aura of magic inside it that's pulling your life force in..."
    "你凝视着断裂的石柱，里面似乎有一股魔法气息，正将你的生命力吸入其中……"

translate schinese_rewrite Whispering_Hollow_Loop_c347dea6:

    # "There are 5 holes at the center of the broken pillar, and [whillar_score] of them are dimly lit."
    "断裂石柱的中央有五个孔洞，其中[whillar_score]个只是微微发亮。"

translate schinese_rewrite Whispering_Hollow_Loop_96741bae:

    # "It seems that something will happen here, if all five lights are ignited."
    "看来只有五盏灯全部点亮，这里才会发生什么。"

translate schinese_rewrite Whispering_Hollow_Loop_9a7de3e2:

    # "You retreat from the pillar."
    "你从石柱旁退开。"

translate schinese_rewrite Whispering_Hollow_Loop_41385b01:

    # "You read the dim paragraph on the pillar."
    "你读着石柱上昏暗的段落。"

translate schinese_rewrite Whispering_Hollow_Loop_03a96509:

    # "{i}I am a moonstone of werewolf might, a symbol of strength in the fight.{w}{p}But to harness my true power and glory, the price of sacrifice must be your story.{/i}"
    "{i}我是承载狼人之力的月光石，是战斗中力量的象征。{w}{p}但若想驾驭我真正的力量与荣耀，你必须把自己的故事作为牺牲献上。{/i}"

translate schinese_rewrite Whispering_Hollow_Loop_6466610a:

    # "Without the amulet, all that's left in the pillar is its own self..."
    "没有护身符，石柱里剩下的就只有它本身……"

translate schinese_rewrite Whispering_Hollow_Loop_c2564626:

    # "You read the shining paragraph on the pillar."
    "你读着石柱上发光的段落。"

translate schinese_rewrite Whispering_Hollow_Loop_03a96509_1:

    # "{i}I am a moonstone of werewolf might, a symbol of strength in the fight.{w}{p}But to harness my true power and glory, the price of sacrifice must be your story.{/i}"
    "{i}我是承载狼人之力的月光石，是战斗中力量的象征。{w}{p}但若想驾驭我真正的力量与荣耀，你必须把自己的故事作为牺牲献上。{/i}"

translate schinese_rewrite Whispering_Hollow_Loop_274aba80:

    # "It fades soon after, leaving only the amulet on top of the pillar."
    "没过多久，光芒便消退，只留下石柱顶端的护身符。"

translate schinese_rewrite Whispering_Hollow_Loop_884f0b56:

    # "You snatch the moonstone amulet from its light, and put it in your bag."
    "你从光芒中一把夺下月光石护身符，放进包里。"

translate schinese_rewrite Whispering_Hollow_Loop_0966c114:

    # "Through the dirt trail, you leave the whispering hollow and return to the dark forest."
    "沿着泥土小径，你离开低语空洞，回到黑暗森林。"
